cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QECCertificates in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "QECCertificates: certified code parameters and fault distances"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 library for certified quantum error correction: the GF(2) and symplectic
  machinery that turns a code parameter into a checkable statement, an in-kernel checker
  for LRAT certificates together with its soundness theorem, and encoding faithfulness in
  both directions, so that a model of the encoded CNF is a light logical operator. Every
  load-bearing declaration is printed in an audit region and depends on no axioms beyond
  the three standard ones.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "An"
    given-names: "Shuoming"
repository-code: "https://github.com/QCL-SUAT/QECCertificates"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-30"
